# SPEC-E2E-001 M1 — stub Toss Payments credentials for the E2E harness only.
#
# NOT named .env.* on purpose — the repo's root .gitignore blanket-ignores
# `.env.*` (secrets discipline), and this file must stay tracked so the E2E
# harness is reproducible from a clean checkout.
#
# These values are never sent anywhere real: the server-side confirm/query
# calls are intercepted before they leave the process
# (e2e/support/mock-toss-api.mjs, plan.md §B), and the browser-side SDK
# script is intercepted by e2e/support/toss-sdk-stub.js (M2). They exist only
# so the application's own startup checks — e.g. loadTossPaymentClient()
# requiring NEXT_PUBLIC_PG_CLIENT_KEY — do not throw before a scenario runs
# (spec.md §4.1, REQ-E2E-004).
#
# Loaded by playwright.config.ts via e2e/support/env-check.ts, which also
# fails the whole run early (before webServer starts) if either value below
# is absent (AC-E2E-003). Root .env is untouched — this file is scoped to
# e2e/ only (B10 PRESERVE discipline).
NEXT_PUBLIC_PG_CLIENT_KEY=test_ck_e2e_stub_0000000000000000
PG_SECRET_KEY=test_sk_e2e_stub_0000000000000000
